sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as LoginController
    participant N as NetworkClient
    participant H as ClientHandler
    participant A as AuthService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant S as SessionManager
    UI->>N: login(account, password) on worker thread
    N->>H: LOGIN request, payloadJson
    H->>A: login
    A->>DB: read account and password hash
    A->>A: verify PBKDF2
    A->>S: create session
    H-->>N: response with sessionId, role and wallet
    N-->>UI: LoginResult
    UI->>UI: Platform.runLater: show auction list
